- `generateCustomerCode(String lastName)` lines 260-264: `prefix = first 3 letters upper-cased`, `sequence = ownerRepository.findAll().size() + 1`, formatted `"%s-%04d"`.
- `normalizeEmail` lines 266-268: `email.toLowerCase(Locale.ROOT)`.
- `normalizeTelephone` lines 270-272: delegates to `E164Telephone.toE164(...)`.
- `assertTelephoneUnique(Owner, String normalized)` lines 280-290: iterates **all** owners; if any other owner (`!existing.getId().equals(owner.getId())`) has the same normalized telephone, throws `DuplicateTelephoneException`.
